---

<section class="section-process">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center header">
            <span class="badge">PROCESS</span>
            <h2>체계적인 4단계<br />성장 시스템</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="process-grid">
            <!-- Step 1 -->
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="step-num">01</span>
                </div>
                <h3>상권·타깃 분석</h3>
                <p>
                    매장 위치와 주요 고객층을<br />정밀하게 분석하여<br />최적의
                    키워드를 뽈아냅니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2 -->
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="step-num">02</span>
                </div>
                <h3>플랫폼 세팅</h3>
                <p>
                    샤오홍슈·따종디엔핑<br />공식 계정을 개설하고<br />매장
                    정보를 등록합니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 3 -->
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="step-num">03</span>
                </div>
                <h3>콘텐츠 운영</h3>
                <p>
                    현지 트렌드에 맞는<br />고퀄리티 콘텐츠를 기획하고<br
                    />인플루언서를 활용합니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 4 -->
            <div class="step-card">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <span class="step-num">04</span>
                </div>
                <h3>반응·유입 관리</h3>
                <p>
                    고객 문의(댓글/DM)에<br />즉각 응대하며<br />실제 방문을
                    유도합니다.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .section-process {
        background-color: var(--section-bg-light);
    }

    .header {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        background: #e9ecef;
        color: #495057;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 100px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .process-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .step-card {
        background: white;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
        text-align: left;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .step-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        border-color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .step-header {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .step-num {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--color-accent);
        background: rgba(255, 192, 0, 0.1);
        padding: 8px 12px;
        border-radius: 12px;
    }

    h3 {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    p {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .process-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .process-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
